1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:01,612
Farming did not make us the

2
00:00:01,612 --> 00:00:03,925
last surviving human species.

3
00:00:04,550 --> 00:00:06,387
Neanderthals disappeared around

4
00:00:06,387 --> 00:00:08,475
forty thousand years ago.

5
00:00:08,475 --> 00:00:10,125
Agriculture began spreading

6
00:00:10,125 --> 00:00:12,413
much later, with major developments

7
00:00:12,413 --> 00:00:14,000
roughly twelve thousand years

8
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:15,750
ago in some regions.

9
00:00:16,200 --> 00:00:17,725
Those dates are approximate,

10
00:00:17,725 --> 00:00:19,212
and farming did not begin

11
00:00:19,212 --> 00:00:20,788
everywhere at once.

12
00:00:20,788 --> 00:00:22,138
The important point is the

13
00:00:22,138 --> 00:00:24,825
gap: tens of thousands of years.

14
00:00:25,450 --> 00:00:27,175
Cities, writing, and modern

15
00:00:27,175 --> 00:00:29,150
industry came later still.

16
00:00:29,600 --> 00:00:31,225
Our ancestors were already

17
00:00:31,225 --> 00:00:33,750
the only surviving human species

18
00:00:33,750 --> 00:00:35,200
before they built the things

19
00:00:35,200 --> 00:00:37,225
we often use to explain human

20
00:00:37,225 --> 00:00:38,325
success.

21
00:00:38,775 --> 00:00:41,000
Their survival has to be investigated

22
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:42,700
through earlier environments,

23
00:00:42,700 --> 00:00:44,900
population history, social

24
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:46,750
connections, expansion, and

25
00:00:46,750 --> 00:00:47,875
interbreeding.

26
00:00:48,350 --> 00:00:50,012
None of those factors supplies

27
00:00:50,012 --> 00:00:51,638
one proven answer for every

28
00:00:51,638 --> 00:00:52,525
place.

29
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:54,288
We tell this story from the

30
00:00:54,288 --> 00:00:55,912
surviving branch.

31
00:00:55,912 --> 00:00:57,588
That can make its outcome feel

32
00:00:57,588 --> 00:00:59,450
inevitable, even when people

33
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:00,925
living through it had no way

34
00:01:00,925 --> 00:01:02,325
to know the ending.
